        "children": [],
        "id": "n-t-h2",
        "name": "N t h2",
        "styles": {
          "font-family": "var(--font-display)",
          "font-size": "1.875rem",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "1.15",
          "margin": "16px 0 0"
        },
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The page"
      },
      "n-t-p1": {
        "attrs": {},
        "breakpoints": {},
        "children": [],
        "id": "n-t-p1",
        "name": "N t p1",
        "styles": {
          "color": "var(--ink-soft)",
          "margin": "0"
        },
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Every photograph here is a NASA image. NASA material is generally not subject to copyright in the United States; the credit lines are the ones NASA asks for. The files were resized for the web and are otherwise unaltered: nothing was retouched, recoloured or composited for this essay."
      },
      "n-t-p2": {
        "attrs": {},
        "breakpoints": {},
        "children": [],
        "id": "n-t-p2",
        "name": "N t p2",
        "styles": {
          "color": "var(--ink-soft)",
          "margin": "0"
        },
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dates and distances come from the public record for each mission. Where a figure is rounded, the text says about."
      },
      "n-t-p3": {
        "attrs": {},
        "breakpoints": {},
        "children": [],
        "id": "n-t-p3",
        "name": "N t p3",
        "styles": {
          "color": "var(--ink-soft)",
          "margin": "0"
        },
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The story page pins each photograph while you scroll and plays one small movement per frame: an opening iris, a turn, a slow zoom to a single pixel. If your device asks for reduced motion, every frame is shown settled, with nothing moving."
      },
      "n-t-p4": {
        "attrs": {},
        "breakpoints": {},
        "children": [],
        "id": "n-t-p4",
        "name": "N t p4",
        "styles": {
          "color": "var(--ink-soft)",
          "margin": "0"
        },
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "It reads in a light and a dark theme. The switch is at the top right of every page."
      },
